Step 08 Route B FFT confidence-gated adaptive window prototype 4c
Prototype scope: add a conservative FFT-confidence gate on top of prototype4b adaptive window.
Route comparison: baseline_true_centerT vs fft_guided_centerT vs fft_guided_centerT_adaptive_window vs fft_confidence_gated_adaptive_window.
Common experiment settings:
snr_list=[14 16 18 20 22 24 26 28], Metkl=200, T_snap=260, tol_deg=0.100
sep_factor_list=[6 7 8 9 10]
Route B internal settings: K_fbss=56, M_full=48, center_beam_count=37, search_scale_B=4.00
FFT settings: Nfft_spatial=4096, gamma_search=1.20, gamma_span=1.50.
Adaptive bounds: search in [0.60, 1.60] x fixed, span in [0.80, 1.60] x fixed.
Confidence gate: fwhm_fft_deg <= 2.050 and peak_ratio >= 1.800.

